---
/** Appikonet på en Beige 3-flis med «Ute» under (Apptest.dc.html). Likt i lys og mørk modus. */
---
<div class="flis">
  <img src="/logo/ute.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="60" height="60" />
  <span>Ute</span>
</div>

<style>
  .flis { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 8px; width: 84px; padding: 14px 0 10px; box-sizing: border-box; background: var(--surface-highlight); border-radius: var(--r-lg); }
  .flis img { width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 14px; display: block; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(49 38 29 / 0.18); }
  .flis span { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1; color: var(--ink); }
</style>
